A||||16||Phantom Rage||simple mod||||1||
Z||000000||Phantom Rage||07-03-2000||06:24 PM||||Ok, this is not a hp/torque mod, but rather just a simple vision mod.  The next time you have to replace your windshield wipers, get some that are one inch longer.  1/2 inch is basically added to the ends of each blade, thus helping to increase the wipe area without taxing the motor too much.  1/2 inch doesn't seem like much but does make a bit of a difference.  Mod helps to reduce that annoying area between the two wipers on the lower part of the windshield. That little area where the wipers cannot wipe, nice for us shorter people <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000001||GT Bastard||07-03-2000||06:41 PM||||But you never said how much hp it adds....||||reg||9
Z||000002||rickb||07-03-2000||07:13 PM||||Now GT Bastard, you know good and well that if it doesn't come with a sticker that you can place somewhere on the car then it doesn't add any hp...Geez, when will they ever learn?||||reg||6
Z||000003||Phantom Rage||07-03-2000||09:08 PM||||GT Bastard: Yes it is good for about 8 dynamic horsepower!!! Add a sticker and it will jump to 10 rear wheel hp <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||12
Z||000004||stimpy||07-03-2000||09:36 PM||||What will really make it "performance" is to get the dual blades with the little adjustable airfoils.  Otherwise this mod will only slow the car down as the drag coefficient is increased due to the increased frontal area from the larger wipers. <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://gifs123.tripod.com/page15/renstimpy2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||Coconut||07-03-2000||10:07 PM||||I don't have the dual wiper blades anymore (puts premature wear on the wiper motors)but for some stupid reason, I just can't get myself to lose those little adjustable airfoils Stimpy was talking about. I don't know why I like them so much (maybe because they add 5 more hp  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">)am I sick, do I need to seek professional help? SOMEONE HELP ME PLEASE!!!!!<P>Mentally Unstable while Cruisin' On,<BR>Coconut <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Larry's_Signature_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
